## Executed automated evidence

The acceptance harness executed 24 assertions and returned:

```text
TOTAL=24 PASS=24 FAIL=0
```

Key executed API observations:

```text
Backend health: HTTP 200
Invalid pollutant: HTTP 400
PM2.5 fallback: HTTP 200; fallback=true; features=10
NO₂ unavailable fallback: HTTP 200; fallback=true; features=0; unit=ppm
Mocked live NO₂: HTTP 200; NO₂ ppm; PM2.5 exposure fields absent
